Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, Kaido, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:14.17,0:01:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm drinking.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.75,0:01:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know I don't like to be\Ninterrupted when I'm drinking.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.84,0:01:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.09,0:01:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all know! But, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.05,0:01:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you a warning.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.93,0:01:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is on his way\Nto you right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.93,0:01:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to scare me?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.93,0:01:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't, if you\Nkeep your hands off him.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.94,0:01:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.41,0:01:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Just sit tight. I'll head to the Land\Nof Wano and take care of that brat, myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta be screwing with me! Hell no!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.14,0:02:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sensitive,\Nit's not about you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.18,0:02:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a personal matter\Nto settle with him,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.17,0:02:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and if I don't take his head\Nmyself, then I'll lose face.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.33,0:02:10.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, his crew took something\Nof mine and I want it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.39,0:02:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.27,0:02:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I recall,\Nyou owe me a bit of a favor.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.01,0:02:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do I, now?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodness,\Ndon't tell me you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.60,0:02:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but it's a lifelong debt.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.44,0:02:37.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Whatever grudge you have against this Straw\NHat kid, I promise you, mine is greater!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.14,0:02:40.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one who kills that punk.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.19,0:02:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you test me, Linlin,\NI'll kill you, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try it, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a warning.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.77,0:02:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't call to ask for your opinion.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.81,0:02:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.94,0:02:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll lop his head off and be done!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should be friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like old times, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.01,0:03:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Big Mom is on the move!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seems like she's\Ngoing to meet up with Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.39,0:03:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're\Nusing an unsecured channel.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.77,0:03:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely, they knew we'd wiretap them.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's they're angle?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to provoke us?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.29,0:03:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should be friends,\Njust like old times, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.08,0:03:22.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One Emperor is enough trouble,\Nbut two is just plain unmanageable.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.08,0:03:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We would need an Admiral,\Nor a couple Warlords at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.14,0:03:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you want me to\Ngo check it out, Sakazuki?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.27,0:03:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think that would be a mistake.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is in Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.81,0:03:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've got highly-skilled\Nwarriors there.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The samurai, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.74,0:03:46.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Garpie, are you listening?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.38,0:03:51.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Big Mom are meeting up\Nand they're going after Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, your grandson.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.18,0:03:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's funny! 
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't see\Nthe humor in this at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your grandson aside, we can't allow
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.44,0:04:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}two of the Four Emperors to team up!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.36,0:04:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you expect us to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, the Reverie's\Ngoing on right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.89,0:04:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All our Marines are busy\Ntaking care of royalty.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we just sit here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't no coincidence, ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.46,0:04:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're talking about Big Mom.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.16,0:04:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}She knew dang well we'd be short on soldiers,\Notherwise I reckon she wouldn'tve been
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.19,0:04:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so bold about this whole business.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure you're right, but still.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, what did the\Nboss man have to say?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said that the Land of Wano\Nis a non-affiliated country,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so it's outside our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.40,0:04:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought so! 
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.47,0:04:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better to mind our own business, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.51,0:04:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If Big Mom and Kaido team up,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.30,0:04:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the Navy will have some major\Nconsequences to deal with.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.64,0:04:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And you should know.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.98,0:04:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the reason you were\Nconsidered a Navy hero.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean the "Rocks," huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.95,0:05:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Funny. I figured you'd be too\Nyoung to know about them, Hina.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.85,0:05:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before Roger showed up,\Nit was their era for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that was 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.76,0:05:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The past is the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.80,0:05:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They may have lost their captain,\Nbut they're not any weaker for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It worries me a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.67,0:05:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll come back,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.67,0:05:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the world's full of "maybes"\Nand that's what makes it so fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.51,0:05:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grinning again, are you?\NI don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.36,0:05:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Enter King Sterry of Goa Kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.93,0:06:06.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it! The center of the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, make your pledge.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.42,0:06:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Can I sit on the throne first?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.25,0:06:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's appropriate\Nto joke about such a thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.44,0:06:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No man, king or otherwise,\Nmay rest upon that seat.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's called the Empty Throne.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.11,0:06:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For all nations of the world are on equal\Nstanding and all rulers must pledge to
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.49,0:06:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,respect each other's sovereignty.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.74,0:06:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weapons that you see here laid before\Nthe throne were placed there 800 years ago
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.96,0:06:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to represent an oath made\Nby the "First Twenty,"
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.29,0:06:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who formed the modern world.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.97,0:06:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This spot lies at the\Nvery center of the world,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.79,0:06:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the fact that none sit upon\Nthe throne is a symbol of peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.21,0:07:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The greatest authority in the government\Nis held by the Five Elders who are
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.30,0:07:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the highest ranking among\Nthe Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.80,0:07:08.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, even amongst them,\Nthat power is divided.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.01,0:07:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is none who would be\Ncalled "King of the World."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, King Sterry,\Nit's time to make your pledge.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.86,0:07:25.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I sit on that chair,\NI'll be the boss of everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling ill?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me sit there!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.33,0:07:41.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away! Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.50,0:07:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I got one! I got one!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.26,0:07:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A big, big mermaid\Nand she's all mine now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.10,0:07:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shirahoshi! 
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not stopping him?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.75,0:08:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot abide by this,\Nno matter the circumstances!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must save her!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.84,0:08:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough wiggling, Miss fishy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.01,0:08:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get those chains on! Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.44,0:08:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.44,0:08:17.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful! Stay back, Princess!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.44,0:08:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll get yourself killed that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.65,0:08:20.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, he's a Celestial Dragon. You can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why should I care\Nabout that? Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Common sense doesn't apply to them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.34,0:08:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll burn down every last inch\Nof Dressrosa if you make them mad!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That big jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Leo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Play it cool, everybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have it your way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Slave 3!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.77,0:09:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be so jealous\Nwhen they see my cute new pet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.19,0:09:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stand by and watch this!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.11,0:09:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this\Nto Luffyland's friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leo, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I guess this is it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm coming for you,\NMermaid Princess!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.50,0:09:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone stop that guy from Kano!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme go!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.32,0:09:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you creeps?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.29,0:09:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think some gratitude\Nis in order first.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.70,0:09:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol 0?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If we hadn't stopped\Nyour little outburst,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.00,0:10:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}several countries\Nmight have met their end.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't stand against\Nthe Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Even a kid knows that much.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.97,0:10:14.23,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol is a secretive organization\Nunder the World Government specializing in
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.56,0:10:16.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,intelligence and assassination.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.56,0:10:20.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"Aigis" 0 is its most powerful unit,\Nunder the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.78,0:10:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons descended from\Nthe gods who created this world.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.91,0:10:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Royalty or not, you exist\Nin a realm beneath them.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.20,0:10:41.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If a god desires something of yours,\Nit must be granted to them.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally, one of you morons gets it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.71,0:10:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call this justice?\NIt doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.46,0:10:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A god is not required to make sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.33,0:10:59.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Otohime, this can't be\Nthe world you dreamed of
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.98,0:11:02.94,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,where we would live under\Nthe same sun as humans.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.44,0:11:06.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know this isn't right!\NMake him stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Princess of Alabasta!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.57,0:11:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.08,0:11:22.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't forget your kindness,\Nbrief as our friendship was,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.46,0:11:26.38,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm sorry that\Nyou have to witness this.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.64,0:11:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll split their skulls and return\Nto the bottom of the sea for good!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.67,0:11:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, but you can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.18,0:11:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If this is what life is like on the surface,\Nthe dream was dead from the start!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.38,0:11:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, King Neptune! You can't give up!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.76,0:11:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let the worst examples\Nof mankind speak for all of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.89,0:11:57.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my love.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.33,0:12:01.04,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No! We'll face the humans together!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.06,0:12:03.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And maybe then.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We can finally make\Na difference for the future,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.10,0:12:09.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,for our children, for this island...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1799,2341,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Even if it's just a small one!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.08,0:12:19.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we bare our hearts\Nto them, humans won't change!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.43,0:12:21.77,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I must save Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the only way!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.13,0:12:25.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You defy me?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.55,0:12:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol, kill him now! Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.56,0:12:29.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.97,0:12:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, King Neptune! Listen to reason!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, Father, please, don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't give in to hatred!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.38,0:12:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone hit a Celestial Dragon!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody look at me! None of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.60,0:13:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.10,0:13:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a fellow Celestial Dragon,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed to see such behavior.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.24,0:13:09.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.48,0:13:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a World Noble, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.05,0:13:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of the princess, you idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies to everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.54,0:13:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This fool brought savagery\Nto your peaceful event!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.45,0:13:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since you look surprised, I assume\Nyou don't remember me, Neptune.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.05,0:13:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I owe the Ryugu Kingdom\Na great debt,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.80,0:13:38.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I have been awaiting\Nthis day for many years.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.47,0:13:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The day that you would come here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.64,0:13:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm a foolish Celestial Dragon, who drifted\Ndown to the Ryugu Kingdom a decade ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.61,0:13:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lost and injured.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.19,0:13:57.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3398,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}I need you to save my life!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.36,0:13:58.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Filthy fools!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.07,0:14:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It was the eloquent words of the late\Nqueen that gave me my humanity.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.70,0:14:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So now, I will do anything\Nin my power to aid you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.03,0:14:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, it is my honor\Nto welcome you to Mary Geoise!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Cipher Pol!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Retreat from here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've traveled quite a long way.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.82,0:14:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This must be important.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Reverie now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.78,0:14:56.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Considering your status, I should think
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'd have the sense\Nto stay out of politics.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.58,0:15:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're willing to honor\Nyour request this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.38,0:15:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you. That's very kind.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.75,0:15:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, then, would you\Nexcuse us for a moment?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.13,0:15:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to speak to you\Nabout a certain pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.52,0:15:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised at\Nhow few people are left.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.48,0:15:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hardly a surprise\Nafter something like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.19,0:15:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone wants to get tangled\Nup in unwanted trouble, you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.58,0:15:56.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There! All better!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.41,0:16:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the bruises have\Ncompletely disappeared!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.55,0:16:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Mansherry.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.43,0:16:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was just like magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.81,0:16:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful power!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.57,0:16:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.44,0:16:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The biggest and\Nthe smallest princesses!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.73,0:16:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's quite the spectacle\Nto see you two together!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was afraid of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.84,0:16:23.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was awfully rude of me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.68,0:16:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aww, it's all right, Mansherry.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.68,0:16:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to beat yourself up!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.34,0:16:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Realistically speaking, all countries\Nhave both good and bad people.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.47,0:16:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We Fishmen are no exception\Nto that rule, either!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude, Myosgard.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.42,0:16:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I could\Nkeep my promise to Otohime.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to thank me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.99,0:16:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, Neptune, consider this\Npayment for saving me long ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.00,0:16:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}During the seven-day conference,\NI promise to look after Princess Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.65,0:16:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm thankful my status is\Nfinally helping someone for once.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.87,0:17:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, then I can kick the Celestial Dragons\Nbutts and say that it was an order?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.62,0:17:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was told I was supposed to\Nkeep my hands off of them,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if you give me permission...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.12,0:17:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. Sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.88,0:17:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will gladly take\Nresponsibility for that!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.40,0:17:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, do what you must\Nto protect the princess!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.82,0:17:17.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, ain't that something.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.30,0:17:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe\None of 'em's got a heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.42,0:17:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.09,0:17:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My most sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.05,0:17:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that there was some trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should have\Nnever left your side.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.98,0:17:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Pell. I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how's my father?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.32,0:17:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Cobra's occupied at the moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.57,0:17:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's with Fujitora.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.86,0:17:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That one Admiral who sent the letter.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.07,0:17:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He wants to speak to King Riku.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.95,0:17:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's give them time.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.77,0:17:51.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pangaea Castle.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.73,0:17:54.69,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It has three entryways\Noutside of its main gate,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.69,0:17:57.40,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,all of which are heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,One of those gates belongs\Nto the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.52,0:18:06.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It leads to the Land of the Gods\Nwhere these nobles reside.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.20,0:18:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! State your name!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.04,0:18:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, it's Queen Dowager\NConney of the Sorbet Kingdom!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.30,0:18:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, ma'am.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of\Nthe Gods lies beyond this point.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.42,0:18:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that it's far too\Ndangerous for you to proceed.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.47,0:18:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please return to the castle.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.52,0:18:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pain! This is unforgivable!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn that Myosgard!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Charloss! Please calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll open your wounds!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.14,0:18:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That man will pay. Mark my words!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.11,0:18:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, open the gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.11,0:18:57.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Charloss is injured!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.65,0:19:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He needs medical\Nassistance immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it! To the doctor!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.41,0:19:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My goodness, Charloss!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.03,0:19:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How are you fairing\Nafter your recent incident?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my poor boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.33,0:19:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After I heard the news,\NI rushed over to get you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.29,0:19:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Roswald! Sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.17,0:19:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Father, is that you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.67,0:19:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did this happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.80,0:19:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my beloved son!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.08,0:19:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's the Queen Dowager?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.99,0:19:56.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That blasted Don Quixote\NMyosgard must pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.01,0:20:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unreal! What kind of Celestial Dragon\Nrefuses to keep even a single slave?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.18,0:20:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's just like that kook Homing who\Ndescended to the lower world 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.04,0:20:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Don Quixote Family has some nerve.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.46,0:20:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That big bunch of lunatics!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.84,0:20:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize, Father!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.22,0:20:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You brought him?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.24,0:20:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The invincible slave, Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.77,0:20:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I did!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.35,0:20:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was finally my long-awaited turn\Nto take him for a spin on the rental list.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.43,0:20:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.27,0:20:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The invincible slave\Nmakes a fine steed, Father.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.98,0:20:34.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wait was surely worth it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.81,0:20:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knew a Warlord would make such\Na fine mode of transportation!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's so much fun to hit him!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.76,0:20:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can stab him, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.93,0:20:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't scream either.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.39,0:20:50.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's truly the finest\Nslave of them all!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's glorious, Father!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want one, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I don't die first!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.32,0:21:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, sir? Let's keep it down.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.28,0:21:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've really had a rotten time\Nsince everyone got here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.74,0:21:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my poor Charloss!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.12,0:21:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's summon the world's greatest\Nphysician to fix you up, shall we?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.21,0:21:21.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to run into\Nhim out in the open like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.53,0:21:32.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}At least I made it inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.66,0:21:39.91,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure they all pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.17,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.45,0:21:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.51,0:21:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Cool your jets, Sabo.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.05,0:21:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Golly, you boys can be so scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.87,0:22:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you're not angy?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.11,0:22:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw what those monsters\Nare doing to our comrade!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.03,0:22:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're torturing that\Npoor, kindhearted man!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.95,0:22:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.70,0:22:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.16,0:22:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We feel you. It really is terrible.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.67,0:22:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I promise that we won't\Nleave Kuma in that state!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.42,0:22:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all,\Nthat's the reason we're here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.70,0:22:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The problem is, even if we free him,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.75,0:22:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he won't\Nreturn to his former self.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.89,0:22:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All his life, Kuma was a victim\Nof the World Government's oppression
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.65,0:22:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in one way or another.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.82,0:22:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They made an example out of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.57,0:22:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a warning, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.37,0:22:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"No one's safe from us.\NEven kings of allied nations."
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.22,0:22:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those who defy the gods will all be\Nbrought to their knees, without question.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.72,0:22:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have the whole Navy\Nand CP-0 on their side.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.77,0:22:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More than anyone can handle.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.56,0:22:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't screw up and get caught.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.73,0:23:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know. We won't.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.94,0:23:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either we succeed or die.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.16,0:23:15.21,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And so, the much-anticipated event,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.21,0:23:18.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the Reverie, commences!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.80,0:23:20.26,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The seas of the world are divided
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.26,0:23:21.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}into four bodies of water.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.34,0:23:25.05,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They are split one way by a massive\Ncontinental wall known as the Red Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.64,0:23:29.64,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and split the other way by a dangerous\Nstretch of sea known as the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.64,0:23:34.15,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Within these waters lies the New\NWorld, where Luffy is traveling.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.56,0:23:37.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Government\Nis a massive organization,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.07,0:23:42.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,encompassing most of the world's\Nnations, 170 in total.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.16,0:23:46.62,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Every four years, 50 chosen\Nrulers are sent to this Holy Land
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.62,0:23:50.75,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,to represent their nations\Nin important negotiations.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.67,0:23:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one is my seat?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.48,0:24:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At long last.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.02,0:24:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed. Tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.77,0:24:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's your country been?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.27,0:24:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said pirates left it\Nin ruin four years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.61,0:24:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're locked up in Impel Down.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.40,0:24:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Courtesy of Fleet Admiral Sakazuki.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.74,0:24:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me, who is this boy I keep\Nhearing about in the news? You know.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.40,0:24:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.64,0:24:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He made an attempt on Big Mom's life,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.99,0:24:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and it's rumored that he has\Nhis sights set on Kaido next.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.16,0:24:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fancy that!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.46,0:24:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Emperor?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.00,0:24:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I wonder what's going to\Nhappen in the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.94,0:24:41.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't participate\Nin the World Government,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.94,0:24:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so needless to say,\Nit's practically a lawless land.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.76,0:24:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,\NI must raise the question.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.39,0:24:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we even consider them a nation?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.72,0:24:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should make\Nthat our business then?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.23,0:24:56.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hardly that simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.37,0:24:58.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy costs money.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.49,0:25:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trouble seems to follow that Straw Hat\NLuffy wherever he goes, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.76,0:25:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.71,0:25:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it! 
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.51,0:25:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, Prodence?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.20,0:25:16.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.13,0:25:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As always, we have a new chairman.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.42,0:25:21.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's up now?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.95,0:25:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.58,0:25:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello there, everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.87,0:25:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Ballywood, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.60,0:25:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.10,0:25:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excellent. He'll run this efficiently.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.64,0:25:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.89,0:25:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have quite a lot to address.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.53,0:25:40.58,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The most influential rulers in all\Nfour seas begin their discussions.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.58,0:25:43.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Together, they will reshape the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.87,0:25:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now! Without further ado,\Nlet's commence the debate.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.61,0:25:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}For seven days, my fellow noblemen,\Nwe shall speak of this beautiful world of ours!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.08,0:26:02.50,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Reverie!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.79,0:26:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems like the conference has begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.13,0:26:08.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While on that subject.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.59,0:26:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cobra, the king of Alabasta,\Nis requesting a special meeting with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.01,0:26:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Nefertari Family, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.93,0:26:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.26,0:26:19.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were the only family\Nof the First Twenty
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.72,0:26:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who stayed in the lower world\N800 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.69,0:26:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then in a sense, they're traitors.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.19,0:26:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has he noticed something out of sorts?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.52,0:26:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he doesn't\Novercomplicate things for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.09,0:26:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Worrisome times.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.47,0:26:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom and Kaido are trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.72,0:26:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This started with the War of the Best,\Nand now, I fear it can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.77,0:26:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The balance of the world\Ncan't be maintained forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.89,0:26:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This we all know.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.98,0:26:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, I believe the time has\Ncome for a great cleansing, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.26,0:28:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you decided upon which "light"
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.64,0:28:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is to be extinguished, Great Lord?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.64,0:28:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who'll be cleansed from history?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.07,0:28:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speak, Lord, and share their name.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
